{"availability":"available","full":"Frank-ZY-Dou/awesome-ai-3d-modeling-robotics","name":"awesome-ai-3d-modeling-robotics","description":"Source-linked examples of AI models used for 3D modeling, industrial design and CAD, and robot control, with archived media and the model named for every case","category":"Design","language":null,"stars":65,"forks":8,"created":"2026-09-19T03:26:02Z","updated":"2026-10-06T16:12:31Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://frank-zy-dou.github.io/awesome-ai-3d-modeling-robotics/","topics":["3d-modeling","ai-for-design","awesome-list","cad","computational-design","llm","robotics"],"demo":"https://qinengwang-aiden.github.io/demos/constraint_demos/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:30:01.612Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T16:30:01.612Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T16:30:01.612Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:19:16.039Z","stars":65,"forks":8},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:48.932Z","stars":65,"forks":8},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:30:01.612Z","stars":65,"forks":8}],"technologies":[],"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:06.163Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Public, source-linked examples of general AI models used for 3D modeling, industrial design and CAD, robot control, and animation, collected from X, LinkedIn, YouTube, Reddit and GitHub. Most cases use OpenAI's GPT-6 Astra, which has the largest public record in these tasks; comparisons and benchmark tables also cover Claude, Gemini, Kimi, DeepSeek and vision-language-action policies such as MolmoAct2. Each entry links to the original post, names the author and date, and quotes the author for any number or claim. The demo videos are archived in this repository.","Every link was opened at its original source before the entry was written; media are archived in this repository. Cases are grouped by application, not by model: each case names the model or models in a Model field, and a comparison of several models on one task stays in the case for that task. Where a model identity comes from the author rather than the vendor, the Model field says so. Reposts and commentary are listed under the original case, not as separate entries.","Public demonstrations arrive quickly and from many places, and reviewing each one in full is slow. A public, maintained index is the practical way to keep an assessment both broad and checkable. Within every subsection, posts whose authors published code that runs the demo, or the workflow or evaluation that produced it, come first; then posts with a live demo website; then posts alone. General-purpose tools a demo used, such as Blender MCP, are listed under Agentic tools and integrations and do not count as the demo's code."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Frank-ZY-Dou/awesome-ai-3d-modeling-robotics/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7db611b295283f5374144a07a2fd38b3b2e61600233acf758f01b3ab932bcd37","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T16:35:30.017Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:35:30.017Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T16:12:31Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Public, source-linked examples of general AI models used for 3D modeling, industrial design and CAD, robot control, and animation, collected from X, LinkedIn, YouTube, Reddit and GitHub. Most cases use OpenAI's GPT-6 Astra, which has the largest public record in these tasks; comparisons and benchmark tables also cover Claude, Gemini, Kimi, DeepSeek and vision-language-action policies such as MolmoAct2. Each entry links to the original post, names the author and date, and quotes the author for any number or claim. The demo videos are archived in this repository.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Frank-ZY-Dou/awesome-ai-3d-modeling-robotics/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"7db611b295283f5374144a07a2fd38b3b2e61600233acf758f01b3ab932bcd37","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Frank-ZY-Dou/awesome-ai-3d-modeling-robotics/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"202